  "title": "Maezo / Agentes",
  "description": "Contadores maezo_agent_* (labels agent/error_type — R-063) + maezo_agent_desfecho_total (CC-09) + maezo_agent_first_response_seconds (GAP 11.2) + as 3 recording rules de KPI (maezo_agent_kpi_derived). Conteudo provisorio ate D12-01-a (documento de SLO) existir — ver nota do PR.",
  "tags": [
    "maezo",
    "agentes",
    "d12-02"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "style": "dark",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "weekStart": "",
  "links": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
